Add a SiFive PWM config fragment, IO port and punchthrough IOBinder.

rocket-chip-blocks has HasPeripheryPWM but Chipyard has no fragment to add a
PWM block, no Port type for it and no IOBinder, so firtool deletes the PWM
outputs of any system that has one. Generic; upstream candidate.

